--- C. an event pushed beyond the ceiling is retired with beyond_horizon
                                                             fill_again                                                              
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
 {"added": 0, "apply": true, "short": [{"quota": 10, "venue": "Big Arena", "short_by": 8}], "parked": 0, "retired": 1, "watched": 2}

 action | axs_event_id |      note      
--------+--------------+----------------
 retire | 802          | beyond_horizon

 source_event_id | days_out 
-----------------+----------
 801             |       30
 803             |      179

